    "images end in Texture, sampler states in Sampler, abbreviations written as a word (BrdfLut, Ssr).",
    "A string value is used everywhere; an object gives per-pass names: `scopes` lists the files (shaders and",
    "the C++ that binds them) for each new name, `default` serves C++ files in no scope (test fixtures).",
    "Entries for names only C++ emits into generated GLSL are included so the generator and its readers agree.",
